<h1>Animalica - Compatibility Pack 3 (Dinosaurs)</h1>
<p>the fox found the dinosaur folder. the den is going to need a larger door.</p>
<h2>what the fox put together</h2>
<p>playable integrations for supported Legacy of the Phanerozoic providers. version 0.4.3 includes the accepted camera integration. source animal mods remain separate and unlock their matching entries.</p>
<h2>bring these along</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>game</strong>: 1.22.3 or later</li>
<li><strong>playermodellib</strong>: 1.22.4 or later</li>
<li><strong>animalicacore</strong>: 1.1.43 or later</li>
</ul>
<h2>the check sheet</h2>
<p>the release record keeps the exact version, package hash and test limits. source compilation is a separate check; it does not establish new gameplay acceptance.</p>
<p><em>mod was made with AI assistance. Pls no hate.</em></p>
